1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,432
Lucknow mein ek metro station banega 122 feet neeche

2
00:00:05,452 --> 00:00:07,436
12 manzil ki building jitna gehra!

3
00:00:07,456 --> 00:00:10,470
Itna gehra kyun? Jawab hai jagah ki kami.

4
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:16,810
Pandeyganj ke aas-paas jagah itni kam hai ki do metro lines bagal-bagal nahi aa sakti.

5
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:21,511
Isliye tracks ek ke upar ek honge upar ek train, neeche doosri.

6
00:00:21,531 --> 00:00:26,744
Paanch manzil ka underground station, aur kharcha lagbhag 400 crore.

7
00:00:26,764 --> 00:00:29,659
Ab tak record tha Kolkata ka Howrah station

8
00:00:29,679 --> 00:00:31,958
jo Hooghly nadi ke neeche hai.

9
00:00:31,978 --> 00:00:37,324
Woh 33 metre gehra hai. Lucknow ka 37 metre ek dum naya record.

10
00:00:37,344 --> 00:00:43,078
Waise bhi metro gehri banti hai, kyunki upar buildings ki neev aur pipes hote hain.

11
00:00:43,098 --> 00:00:46,370
Tunnel unke neeche se nikaalni padti hai.

12
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:50,810
Agli baar metro ki lambi seedhiyan dekho, toh wajah yaad rakhna!

13
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:56,260
Aur aise hi videos ke liye subscribe kare Whysplained ko.
